      "id": "aria-hidden-focus",
      "title": "`[aria-hidden=\"true\"]` elements contain focusable descendents",
      "description": "Focusable descendents within an `[aria-hidden=\"true\"]` element prevent those interactive elements from being available to users of assistive technologies like screen readers. [Learn how `aria-hidden` affects focusable elements](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.13/aria-hidden-focus).",
