      "title": "Links are distinguishable without relying on color.",
      "description": "Low-contrast text is difficult or impossible for many users to read. Link text that is discernible improves the experience for users with low vision. [Learn how to make links distinguishable](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.13/link-in-text-block).",
