      "title": "List items (`<li>`) are contained within `<ul>`, `<ol>` or `<menu>` parent elements",
      "description": "Screen readers require list items (`<li>`) to be contained within a parent `<ul>`, `<ol>` or `<menu>` to be announced properly. [Learn more about proper list structure](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.13/listitem).",
      "score": null,
